Package: TMScal
Type: Package
Title: Tumor Mutational Spectrum Prognostic Calculator
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Xue", "Cheng", email = "xuecheng@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A tool for predicting prognostic risks using Tumor Mutational 
    Spectrum (TMS) from whole exome sequencing (WES) data of MSS 
    (microsatellite stable) cancer patients. Provides functions for 
    data preparation, pathway stability analysis, feature selection,
    model training, and prediction of prognostic risk groups.
    The method uses 192 trinucleotide mutational pathways with 
    adaptive stability-based feature selection.
